{"id":"word:hebrew:H2181","type":"word","title":"זָנָה","subtitle":"H2181 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to commit adultery (usually of the female, and less often of simple fornication, rarely of involuntary ravishment); figuratively, to commit idolatry (the Jewish people being regarded as the spouse of Jehovah)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to זָנָה (H2181) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 93 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"זָנָה (zânâh) means to commit adultery (usually of the female, and less often of simple fornication, rarely of involuntary ravishment); figuratively, to commit idolatry (the Jewish people being regarded as the spouse of Jehovah) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 25."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"זָנָה","transliteration":"zânâh","pronunciation":"zaw-naw'","strong":"H2181","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2181","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["לִ/זְנ֖וֹת","זוֹנָ֖ה","זוֹנָ֔ה","זוֹנָ֑ה","וְ/זָנ֣וּ"],"morphs":[["HVqrfsa",17],["HC/Vqw2fs",6],["HC/Vqw3mp",5],["HR/Vqc",5],["HC/Vqw3fs",4],["HTd/Vqrfsa",4],["HVqi3fs",3],["HR/Vqrfsa",3],["HVqrmpa",3],["HVqp3fs",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"to commit adultery (usually of the female, and less often of simple fornication, rarely of involuntary ravishment); figuratively, to commit idolatry (the Jewish people being regarded as the spouse of Jehovah)","usage":"(cause to) commit fornication, × continually, × great, (be an, play the) harlot, (cause to be, play the) whore, (commit, fall to) whoredom, (cause to) go a-whoring, whorish.","full":"H2181. zanah זָנָה verb commit fornication, be a harlot (Arabic commit fornication , Aramaic , זנא ; compare Ethiopic effusio seminis virilis, seman effusum , Di 1055 ; on this and (compare by Ges and others) see Prät BAS i. 32, Anm .) — Qal Perfect ׳ז Deut 31:16 , זָָֽנְתָה Genesis 38:34 3 t., etc.; Imperfect יִזְנֶ֯ה (Kt) Ezek 23:43 ; תִּזְנֶה Lev 19:29 4 t.; וַתִּ֫זֶן Jer 3:8 ; Ezek 23:5 ; תִּזְנִי Hosea 3:3 ; וַתִּזְנִי Jer 3:6 (but read probably ׃וַתִּזֶן וַתִּזְנִי is not Aramaic form of 3 feminine singular, see Kö i. 540 Kau § 47 g b ) Ezek 16:15 4 t.; וַתִּזְנִים 16:28 ; יִזְנוּ (Qr) 23:43 ; וַיִּזְנוּ Judg 8:27 4 t.; תִּזְנֶינָה Hosea 4:13-14 , וַתִּזְנֶינָה Ezek 23:3 ; Infinitive absolute זָנֹה Hosea 1:2 ; construct לִזְנוֺת Lev 20:5 3 t.; לִזְנֹת 20:6 ; suffix בִּזְנוֺתֵךְ Ezek 23:30 ; Participle זוֺנֶה Psa 73:27 ; Ezek 6:9 ; זֹנֶה Hosea 4:15 ; plural זֹנִים Lev 17:7 3 t.; זוֺנָה Deut 23:19 25 t.; זֹנָה Lev 21:7 2 t.; זוֺנוֺת Prov 29:3 ; זֹנוֺת Hosea 4:14 4 t. — 1 be or act as a harlot , absolute Gen 38:24 (J), Deut 22:21 (D), Lev 21:9 (H), Hosea 4:13-14 , Amos 7:17 ; זונה + (ה)אשׁה Josh 2:1 ; 6:22 (J), Lev 21:7 (H), Judg 11:1 ; 16:1 ; Prov 6:26 ; Jer 3:3 ; Ezek 16:30 ; 23:44 ; זוֺנָה Gen 34:31 ; 38:15 ; Josh 6:17 , 25 (all J), Deut 23:19 ; Lev 21:14 (H), Prov 7:10 ; 23:27 ; Isa 23:15-16 , Joel 4:3; Micah 1:7 (twice in verse); Ezek 16:31 ; זֹנוֺת נָשִׁים 1Kin 3:16 ; ז(ו)נות 22:38 ; Prov 29:3 ; Hosea 3:3 ; 4:14 ; Ezek 16:33 ; זונה בית Jer 5:7 ; commit fornication , man's act ׳ז אל Num 25:1 (J); of woman's act Judg 19:2 ; of land given to harlotry Lev 19:29 . 2 figurative of improper intercourse with foreign nations (religious reference sometimes involved) ׳ז את Isa 23:17 ; אחרי Ezek 23:30 ; אל 16:26 , 28 (twice in verse); ׳ז תַזְנוּתיה 23:43 ; Nahum 3:4 ; תַחְתָּ֑י אָהֳלָה וַתִּזֶן and Ohola committed fornication (whilst) under me Ezek 23:5 (compare Num 5:19 ). 3 of intercourse with other deities , considered as harlotry, sometimes involving actual prostitution, ׳ז אחרי Exod 34:15-16 , Deut 31:16 (all J), Lev 17:7 ; 20:5 (twice in verse) (all H), Judg 2:17 ; 8:27 , 33 ; 1Chr 5:25 ; Ezek 6:9 ; 20:30 ; after אֹבֹת , etc. Lev 20:6 (H), one's own heart & eyes Num 15:39 (H); especially of Israel, Judah, and Jerusalem under figure of lewd woman Ezek 16:15 (absolute) 16:16 ( במית על ), 16:17 ( ׳ז בְ ), 23:3 (twice in verse); 23:19 (absolute), Jer 3:1 (with accusative); 3:6 ; 3:8 (absolute); absolute elsewhere Hosea 2:7 ; 4:15 ; Isa 57:3 ; Psa 106:39 ; as leaving ׳י , followed by מֵעַל Hosea 9:1 ; מאחרי 1:2 (twice in verse); מתחת 4:12 ; followed by מן alone Psa 73:27 ; ז(ו)נה Jer 2:20 ; Ezek 16:35 , 41 ; זונה בית Jer 5:7 ; הַזּוֺנֶה לִבָּם their whorish heart Ezek 6:9 . 4 זונה of moral defection Isa 1:21 . Pu`al Perfect 3masculine singular זוּנָּה לֹא אַהֲרַיִךְ fornication was not done (in going) after thee Ezek 16:34 (but strike out Co). Hiph`il Perfect 2masculine singular הִזְנֵיתָ Hosea 5:3 ; 3 plural חִזְנוּ 4:10 , 18 ; Exod 34:16 ; Imperfect וַיֶּ֫זֶן 2Chr 21:11 ; וַתַּזְנֶה 21:13 ; Infinitive absolute הַזְנֵה Hosea 4:18 ; construct הַזְנוֺת 2Chr 21:13 ; suffix לְהַזְנוֺתָהּ Lev 19:29 . 1 cause to commit fornication: a. sexual Lev 19:29 (H). b. religious Exod 34:16 (J), 2Chr 21:11 , 13 (twice in verse). 2 commit fornication: a. sexual Hosea 4:10 . b. religious Hosea 4:18 (twice in verse); 5:3 .","rootNote":"a primitive root [highly fed and therefore wanton ];","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 25","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 25","2Chr 21 11","2Chr 21 13","2Chr 21 13","Amos 7 17","Deut 22 21","Deut 23 19","Deut 31 16"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":93,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 25","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּזְנ֗וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 21 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":21,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יֶּ֨זֶן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 21 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":21,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/תַּזְנֶ֤ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw2ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 21 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":21,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כְּ/הַזְנ֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","